haversine:
```js
function haversineKm(lat1, lon1, lat2, lon2){
  const R = 6371;
  const p1 = lat1*DEG, p2 = lat2*DEG, dl = (lat2-lat1)*DEG, dg = (lon2-lon1)*DEG;
  const a = Math.sin(dl/2)**2 + Math.cos(p1)*Math.cos(p2)*Math.sin(dg/2)**2;
  return 2*R*Math.asin(Math.sqrt(a));
}
```

